{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"保存本轮实际实施、验证及研究选择理由。","content_hash":"1eec1450977f79c381cedbb4611d00c29347b7d49d4719d7ec5314be1faf60fa","created_at":"2026-09-12T20:11:32.797663Z","created_by":{"id":"Codex","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"owner_only","keywords":["基础召回","正文块","混合检索","验证边界"],"kind":"document_section","level":null,"owner_id":"RES-AI-EXPERIENCE-CONTEXT","payload":{"blocks":[{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"4d1e741bc6d3391375d1c6c4a3fe385cb126ff331b557d7380c1fdd90e684204","target_id":"MEM-9c01d700-8f72-5af1-9f33-ed40ff930348","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"e38326b9dcb18f70bc3718fb32e8c8103b92b03f7fb5e9799e093cb19295555b","target_id":"MEM-6e24248d-f205-5788-b16a-75b7f2591dbb","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"e2e349fc4a60261ef1c56e3aff6295d549499f244cc30a94b01bfd5eaf62282e","target_id":"MEM-6aa53d53-659c-5507-bb4c-74f72228f070","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"基础召回之后，用户进一步确定读取和补查方式。以下先保留用户偏好与解释，再呈现实际实现，避免把原提议当成当时已有能力。","type":"prose"},{"ref":{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"4d1e741bc6d3391375d1c6c4a3fe385cb126ff331b557d7380c1fdd90e684204","target_id":"MEM-9c01d700-8f72-5af1-9f33-ed40ff930348","target_kind":"record"},"type":"unit"},{"ref":{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"e38326b9dcb18f70bc3718fb32e8c8103b92b03f7fb5e9799e093cb19295555b","target_id":"MEM-6e24248d-f205-5788-b16a-75b7f2591dbb","target_kind":"record"},"type":"unit"},{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"e2e349fc4a60261ef1c56e3aff6295d549499f244cc30a94b01bfd5eaf62282e","target_id":"MEM-6aa53d53-659c-5507-bb4c-74f72228f070","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"用户认可分层多路、完整阅读及必要细节方案后，明确授权开发。选择在现有材料应用之上增加RS阅读工作流，复用Reader/Assembler和本地向量，不把工作笔记伪装成规范知识。\n\n先实现分层候选与完整交付，再接通笔记和续接。早期测试发现来源模式要求full+reject，修复请求规范化；续批发现Python数组序列化差异，统一输出边界。真实浮点检索的首个请求错误限制必要Run依据，保留拒绝回执，重新明确直接范围与必要依据范围后取得8候选并完成实际阅读写回。多个块共享定义的重复输出也经回归修正。\n\n当前方案已实现为material-query reading CLI/HTTP与Skill：需要检索时多路跨层，短候选全文、技术块及必要依赖，保留后完整阅读，AI保存理解、连接和必要细节。RS会话保留目标、条件、尝试、固定来源和累计预算；可执行下一步先推进，失败后定向补查，再次扩查默认人工取舍。56项不重复行为测试与18项升级测试通过；浮点材料真实AI读全文、写笔记和新进程恢复完成。这证明当前软件链路可用，不证明广泛任务质量改善或架构最优。没有后台AI、自动宿主注入或独立阅读面板。\n\n下一阶段用真实问题比较误排除、间接启发的实际价值、停止时机、阅读成本和解决质量；不把本次软件结果升级为普遍检索优势。","type":"prose"}],"missing_refs":[],"role":"discussion","section_key":"reading-v03","title":"多路阅读方案与程序：从用户选择到验证","watch_refs":[]},"previous_revision":null,"provenance_gap":null,"record_hash":"33f8712b895c8e3acab0b4d84634a6d7fd9c28a48ba8d02fe94e109c7f2adebe","record_id":"MEM-14bac61c-ae5c-56be-a0c1-54d60a74cfec","record_reason":"保存本轮实际实施、验证及研究选择理由。","revision":1,"schema_version":3,"sensitivity":"internal","sources":[{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"4d1e741bc6d3391375d1c6c4a3fe385cb126ff331b557d7380c1fdd90e684204","target_id":"MEM-9c01d700-8f72-5af1-9f33-ed40ff930348","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"e38326b9dcb18f70bc3718fb32e8c8103b92b03f7fb5e9799e093cb19295555b","target_id":"MEM-6e24248d-f205-5788-b16a-75b7f2591dbb","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"e2e349fc4a60261ef1c56e3aff6295d549499f244cc30a94b01bfd5eaf62282e","target_id":"MEM-6aa53d53-659c-5507-bb4c-74f72228f070","target_kind":"record"}],"title":"多路阅读方案与程序：从用户选择到验证","updated_at":"2026-09-12T20:11:32.797663Z","updated_by":{"id":"Codex","kind":"ai"}}